  "info": {
    "name": "Flying Bird - Game Login",
    "description": "For the game developer: one request. Change baseUrl to the live server.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"gameId\": \"{{gameId}}\",\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"{{deviceId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "The only endpoint the game needs.\n\n- Send username + password (given by the admin) + a deviceId unique to this PC (8-64 chars: letters, numbers, -). Use the SAME deviceId every time on the same PC.\n- First successful login locks the account to that deviceId. Another PC gets 403 WRONG_DEVICE.\n- ok: true = allowed to play. Call it on game start (and whenever you want to re-check).\n- Any error body: { ok: false, code, message }. Show the player a message based on `code`.\n- token: keep it for future endpoints (not needed now).\n\nSee the saved Examples (right side) for every possible response."
      },
